  Class: 22
  Name: Jacks
  Description: Two jacks herd the cell's wildlife. Herding, run each jack with a thumb,
    lift it to leave a decoy, pull a trigger to dash both jacks to it, and call the herd.
    Netting, fly them, one fish under each thumb, with a net between them that opens as
    the sticks go apart. D-pad left or right switches between herding and netting.
